Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All that dueling made me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did any of you guys remember\Nto bring any food with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What were we thinking\Ncoming here with no food?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How were we ever going\Nto get through the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,of the competition\Nwithout anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good question, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This dueling really takes it out of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't seen any burger stands\Nor restaurants since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we better do something fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to have my five basic food\Ngroups or else it's metabolic meltdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, chill out, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it covered. Yeah? Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Outdoor Survival Guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It lists all the plants, roots,\Nberries, and grasses we can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look like a squirrel, you big doofus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your dumb book anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.71,0:02:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell something cooking that-a-way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it wasn't his brain\Nthat beat Mai, it was his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I just love\Nbarbecued fish. Smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I bet it tastes even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think those\Nfish are yours to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, trust me, we eat first\Nand ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.59,0:02:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His stomachs will thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he'd say anything to fill his belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people have absolutely\Nno self-control. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, save some for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, man, this looks awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, hot, hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, set, feeding frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves, you fish thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you eat my fish,\Nyou thieving poachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Has no one taught you manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So can we eat now? All\Nright, let's try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,one more time i knew this was a bad idea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,how dare you steal my fish you\Nbottom feeding thieves hey chill out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,guy it's just a few fish a few fish\Nthat do not belong to you and to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,steal a fisherman's catch is to\Nprove you have no honor a dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,glove wait a second aren't you mako\Ntsunami the top rank ocean duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're that freaky fish guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a freaky fish guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mako Tsunami, duelist\Nextraordinaire of the seven seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what are you laughing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Off with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're demented.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that those\Ntwo are here as duelists?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about your fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Yugi Moto, the only duelist\Nto ever defeat Seto Kaiba? Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be my very great\Nhonor to face you in a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ungracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are friends of Yugi\NMoto, please come sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeding, Frenzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Freaky Fish Guy\Nreally knows how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really good, huh? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you learn to cook like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had to fend for\Nmyself since I was a tadpole,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was my father who\Ntaught me how to fish and cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you\Nhere to the competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was raised on a fishing boat where I\Nlearned to love the sea, so if I win here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love a vessel of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll have to\Nbeat a few duelists first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How great would that be, living\Nlife out on the big blue sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the ocean is amazing, and we have\Nshared a special bond since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell when the sea is\Nhappy by the way it sparkles,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and when it is angry\Nby the shifting tides.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I did not mean\Nto be so serious. Oh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,don't apologize You saved our hides,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be starving without you\NThis has really been great
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:05:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving so soon, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you, Mako Maybe\Nwe'll meet up in the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We certainly will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner than you think, my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I treated you to dinner.\NPerhaps you will honor me with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a duel he's nuts no but I am\Nan expert fisherman and you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,have taken my bait why the\Nfish of course I laid it out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And lured you three right in,\Nbut I never expected to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi moto ah forget this\Ncrazy chicken in the sea yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,can't we just give the guy\Nback a few fish i reeled in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,another duelist a short time\Nago but he was not a worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,opponent but a duel against\Nyou yugi would be a true test
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Meiko Tsunami, I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall battle beside the majestic sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The playing field is equally\Nsplit into two halves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One half is land, the other is sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And the stakes, Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wager two starships on this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Two stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally an adversary of real merit.\NHow I have waited for this day. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:08:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the battle begin. This should
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,be some match sink that soggy sucker
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi i'm curious to see how you\Nwill combat my mighty denizens of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the deep what's this his creature
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,is underwater how do i choose which
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,card to play when I can't\Neven see what I'm fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean conceals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,many things beneath its shifting surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as that thing stays\Nsubmerged, I can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise he won't stay\Nsubmerged for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what that\Nthing is down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so I better prepare for the worst\Nwith as strong a defense as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.53,0:08:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, clearly this is Yu-Gi's first\Nencounter with sea-based duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You will learn firsthand what\Na powerful ally the sea can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives my creatures a field\Npower bonus, and it conceals them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.65,0:08:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,making their stealthy\Nattacks even more lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he fight when he can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is totally bogus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that my ocean-based strategy\Nhas taken you by surprise, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but I can still\Nraise a strong defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I call upon the Horned Imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Fiend Kraken, ensnare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My Imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's bad news for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's imp is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiend Kraken, end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, and that was just his opening move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A brilliant opening play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pleased you appreciate it,\Nthough I very much doubt your imp did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now I know what I'm up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the mighty ocean commands respect,\Nas do the creatures that inhabit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can prepare an attack\Nthat will destroy his creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I can't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Feral imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My feral imp should dispense\Nwith Mako's monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how deep\Nthey're hidden in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am familiar with your feral\Nmonster, and it's electrical attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So for my next card, I\Nplay my giant jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the battle cry of my creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be crying, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,once I combine my feral imp with\Nthe magical horn of the unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can't see Mako's monsters, but\Nhe knows they're all underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and water conducts electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so they're vulnerable to the\Nferal imp's electrical attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.03,0:11:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that is so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic lightning, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fish fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, what is this?\NNothing's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako still has all his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strategy has failed, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As a sea duelist, I am well aware\Nthat water conducts electricity,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I played my giant jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the magical ability to\Nabsorb all electrical attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting all of my ocean creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for my counter-attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiend Kraken, crush his feral limb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy my Kraken's embrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never dueled against\Ncreatures like these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels as if I'm battling\NMako's sea monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and the awesome power of the ocean itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do any of your cards have the power\Nto stand against my ocean pets?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the power of Silverfang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and I combine him with the magic of\Nthe full moon to double his ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ferocious indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:13:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But the moon also controls the\Ntides, causing them to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing me to unleash my next creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, mighty Koryoshin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that is one big fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the colossal Koryoshin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,a creature so enormous that when\Nhe rises up from the ocean depths,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he creates his own tidal wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wolf is brave, Yugi, but he will not\Nstand before my Karyushin's title attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Silver Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But my Karyushin's title attack did more\Nthan simply wash your wolf cub away. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It considerably altered our playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My land!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Karyushin's attack has nearly washed\Naway my entire land-based playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You should consider yourself lucky, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In my previous duels,\Nwhen Kuryushin attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,absolutely nothing is\Nleft standing in its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was quite\Nconsiderate of my pet to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,leave you a little patch\Nof dirt to stand on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does it make you uneasy to be\Nsurrounded on all sides by the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All men give pause before the\Nsavage power of the mighty ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,even the greatest of fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was a great fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught me my love of the sea,\Nbut one day the sea took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved going out on\Nthe boat with my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,just the two of us and\Nthe big, beautiful ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,never suspecting that\Nthe sea would turn on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Mako, there's a storm\Nblowing in. A big one? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned to never\Ntake chances with the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And father was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, the calm, friendly sea\Nturned into a raging maelstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It pitched our boat as if it were a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:14:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I can't hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I've tied you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When the storm finally died out,\Nour little boat had washed ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I had been perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But because he had stopped to tie me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He had no time to secure\Nhimself to the mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.89,0:15:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I had lost him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I noticed that\Nour lifeboat was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my father is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will win this contest, buy a ship,\Nand search the seven seas until I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why I must win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Mako. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still can't let you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako duels for his dad like\NYugi duels for his grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is too intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:16:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With so little land left to me, I've\Nreally got to make this next play count.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something that will\Nhelp me turn the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant Soldier of Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.77,0:16:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have shrunk my\Nbattlefield down to an island,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako, but my stone soldier\Nstill gets a field power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your massive monster can\Nbarely fit on that little rock,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone do battle with\Nmy undersea attack force.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And he is surrounded on\Nall sides by the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,making him easy prey\Nfor Great White Terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This savage shark will lead my other sea\Ncreatures in an all-out ocean onslaught.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, Yugi's guy is\Noutnumbered three to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone soldier's\Nabout to become fish food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, but you played honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been a fair and\Nnoble opponent too, Mako,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I also duel with the\Nfate of a loved one at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I switch my stone soldier to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.07,0:17:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He cannot attack my sea monsters\Nwhile they are underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But his target isn't your sea monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having him attack a card\NI put on the field myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, stone soldier, destroy the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,what's happening the tide\Nit's going out but how
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,as you yourself said before\Nmako it is the moon that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,controls the ocean's tides\Nits ebb and its flow so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,i ordered my stone soldier\Nto obliterate the moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,causing the ocean's tides to\Nreverse and recede. Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My stone soldier has beached\Nall your sea monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no ocean left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my precious fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll deliver the final blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I combine my curse of dragon\Ncard with the magic of the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,burning land card to wipe out\Nyour remaining life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning land attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And that takes your life\Npoints down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying your own moon card was a\Nbrilliant and unexpected move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a grand duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I salute you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This victory was not easily won, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a great duelist yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am down to one star, Chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will start over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet you'll do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd win that wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I can't help but like that Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a great guy and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he finds his father someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, dueling you is hungry work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Mako to fish again. Beware!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish he'd bring us some fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have to duel him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But guys, I am getting seriously hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got my great\Noutdoor survival guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Go ahead, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat all the pages you like.
